      "text": "You don't need\na degree.\nYou need a prompt."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "type": "body",
      "layout": "edge_bleed",
      "text": "It used to be that by a certain age, you had to choose what you wanted to be for the rest of your life.\n\nNow you don't."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "type": "body",
      "layout": "open",
      "text": "You can be many things."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "type": "body",
      "layout": "edge_bleed",
      "text": "The haters claiming successful people only made it because of luck or money are getting exposed —\n\nas the ones who never had any discipline in the first place."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "type": "body",
      "layout": "open",
      "text": "So what's your excuse now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "type": "body",
      "layout": "edge_bleed",
      "text": "If you can think it,\nyou can make it.\n\nThe new skill is how willing you are to use your brain."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "type": "body",
      "layout": "open",
      "text": "Your time is NOW."
    },
